{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"]},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Corsair","text":"<p> Corsair navigates you through the CSR seas. No more mismatches between hardware, software, and documentation. [BADGES HERE] </p> Documentation |   Repository <p>Corsair is a CLI tool and Python library designed to define and manage Control and Status Register (CSR) maps for HDL projects. It generates code and documentation from a single CSR description file, effectively eliminating any mismatches between different representations of registers.</p>"},{"location":"#features","title":"Features","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"#quick-start","title":"Quick Start","text":"<p>TDB</p>"},{"location":"#license","title":"License","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"changelog/","title":"Changelog","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"contributing/","title":"Contributing","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"first-steps/","title":"First Steps","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"installation/","title":"Installation","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"api/","title":"API Reference","text":""},{"location":"blog/","title":"Blog","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/","title":"Build File Reference","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/config/","title":"Configuration","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/asciidoc/","title":"Asciidoc Documentation for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/c-header/","title":"C Header for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/custom/","title":"Custom Target for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/markdown/","title":"Markdown Documentation for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/sv-package/","title":"SystemVerilog-2017 Package for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"location":"build-file/targets/sv/","title":"SystemVerilog-2017 Module for Register Map","text":"<p>TBD</p>"},{"locatio